.include buck_avg.sub

* nom.lt: L = 1 x 1 uH, C = 1 x 44 uF, 0.1 A, on-resistance x 1
Vin1 vin1 0 4.2
X1 vin1 o1 f1 buck_avg params: L=1u C=44u RHS=50m RLS=30m
Vj1 f1 o1 DC 0 AC 1
Il1 o1 0 DC 0.1

* nom.hv: L = 1 x 1 uH, C = 1 x 44 uF, 1 A, on-resistance x 1.4
Vin2 vin2 0 4.2
X2 vin2 o2 f2 buck_avg params: L=1u C=44u RHS=70m RLS=42m
Vj2 f2 o2 DC 0 AC 1
Il2 o2 0 DC 1

* lmcm.lt: L = 0.8 x 1 uH, C = 0.8 x 44 uF, 0.1 A, on-resistance x 1
Vin3 vin3 0 4.2
X3 vin3 o3 f3 buck_avg params: L=0.8u C=35.2u RHS=50m RLS=30m
Vj3 f3 o3 DC 0 AC 1
Il3 o3 0 DC 0.1

* lmcm.hv: L = 0.8 x 1 uH, C = 0.8 x 44 uF, 1 A, on-resistance x 1.4
